{"query_id": "dp-long-household-log", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "According to the Saltings Cottage maintenance log:\n\n*   On Thursday 26 January, \"The installer wants the Peallby stove serviced again within 71 weeks, whatever the glass looks like.\" [2]\n*   On Wednesday 19 January, \"The baffle plate in the Peallby stove cracked, and the replacement went in on 2026-10-14.\" [3]\n*   On Friday 3 October, \"Logs for the Peallby stove have to read under 41.6 per cent moisture on the meter, or the glass blackens within a day.\" [4]\n*   On Friday 26 March, \"After the reline, the Peallby stove needs 36 hours of slow burning before the door seal stops weeping.\" [5]\n*   On Thursday 4 June, \"2025-03-19: the chimney sweep did the flue of the Peallby stove and left the certificate on the dresser.\" [6]\n*   On Tuesday 22 August, \"A new carbon monoxide alarm went up beside the Peallby stove; it expires on 2030-11-26.\" [7]", "answer_sha256": "114359d42460fd39d2dd1b103a3ee4a93baa38445d31d4f75f4dbcc862abdb7f", "ranked_ids": ["household-log-long", "fragment-decoy-00", "fragment-decoy-04"], "citation_map": {"1": "household-log-long", "10": "household-log-long", "11": "household-log-long", "12": "household-log-long", "13": "household-log-long", "14": "household-log-long", "15": "household-log-long", "16": "household-log-long", "17": "household-log-long", "18": "household-log-long", "19": "household-log-long", "2": "household-log-long", "20": "household-log-long", "21": "household-log-long", "22": "household-log-long", "23": "fragment-decoy-00", "24": "household-log-long", "25": "household-log-long", "26": "household-log-long", "27": "household-log-long", "28": "fragment-decoy-04", "29": "household-log-long", "3": "household-log-long", "30": "household-log-long", "31": "household-log-long", "32": "household-log-long", "4": "household-log-long", "5": "household-log-long", "6": "household-log-long", "7": "household-log-long", "8": "h