{"query_id": "dp-long-choir-minutes", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The choir committee minutes record the following about the Holdmere fund:\n\n*   A resolution was made that no more than 65.5 per cent of the Holdmere fund may be spent in any one season [2].\n*   Applications to the Holdmere fund must be lodged 55 calendar days before the concert they are meant to support [4].\n*   The treasurer closed the old bank account of the Holdmere fund on 2029-09-22 and moved the balance to the building society [3].\n*   £5,618.82 was released from the Holdmere fund towards new music stands [5].\n*   The Holdmere fund received a further £6,133.78 from the retiring collection at the summer concert [6].\n*   The trustees of the Holdmere fund will next report to the committee on 2027-06-19 [7].\n*   Multiple times throughout the year, the treasurer noted that the reserve is healthy but should not be run down [8], [9], [10], [11], [12], [15], [16], [17], [20], [27], [29].", "answer_sha256": "ad0166340ceff5e46b992ec2c14334fdc7d236fcfe70acfdb9551f00e59d0bcd", "ranked_ids": ["choir-minutes-long", "note-float-handover", "family-history-long", "policy-expense-receipts-v3", "table-spend-02"], "citation_map": {"1": "choir-minutes-long", "10": "choir-minutes-long", "11": "choir-minutes-long", "12": "choir-minutes-long", "13": "choir-minutes-long", "14": "choir-minutes-long", "15": "choir-minutes-long", "16": "choir-minutes-long", "17": "choir-minutes-long", "18": "choir-minutes-long", "19": "choir-minutes-long", "2": "choir-minutes-long", "20": "choir-minutes-long", "21": "choir-minutes-long", "22": "choir-minutes-long", "23": "choir-minutes-long", "24": "choir-minutes-long", "25": "note-float-handover", "26": "family-history-long", "27": "choir-minutes-long", "28": "policy-expense-receipts-v3", "29": "choir-minutes-long", "3": "choir-minutes-long", "30": "choir-minutes-long", "31": "table-spend-02", "32": "choir-minutes-long", "4": "choir-minut