{"query_id": "dp-long-apiary-log", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The apiary log records the following about the Slantgate hive:\n\n*   The Slantgate hive was treated for varroa; the strips stay in for 67 calendar days and then come out without fail [2].\n*   Honey from the supers on the Slantgate hive read 42.4 per cent moisture on the refractometer, dry enough to extract [3].\n*   Brood in the Slantgate hive covered 45.3 per cent of the frames checked, all of it capped and even [4].\n*   Queen seen in the Slantgate hive on 2028-09-14, marked yellow and laying well across five frames [5].\n*   The clearer board went on the Slantgate hive for 27 hours before the supers were lifted off [6].\n*   The Slantgate hive swarmed on 2034-05-20; the swarm was taken from the hedge and housed in the spare box [7].", "answer_sha256": "ca6218951a56ea4ec33add3f3c2cca4226b650abcc23ad7c760bfb42ed92808e", "ranked_ids": ["apiary-log-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "apiary-log-long", "10": "apiary-log-long", "11": "apiary-log-long", "12": "apiary-log-long", "13": "apiary-log-long", "14": "apiary-log-long", "15": "apiary-log-long", "16": "apiary-log-long", "17": "apiary-log-long", "18": "apiary-log-long", "19": "apiary-log-long", "2": "apiary-log-long", "20": "apiary-log-long", "21": "apiary-log-long", "22": "apiary-log-long", "23": "apiary-log-long", "24": "apiary-log-long", "25": "apiary-log-long", "26": "apiary-log-long", "27": "apiary-log-long", "28": "apiary-log-long", "29": "apiary-log-long", "3": "apiary-log-long", "30": "apiary-log-long", "31": "apiary-log-long", "32": "apiary-log-long", "33": "apiary-log-long", "34": "apiary-log-long", "35": "apiary-log-long", "4": "apiary-log-long", "5": "apiary-log-long", "6": "apiary-log-long", "7": "apiary-log-long", "8": "apiary-log-long", "9": "apiary-log-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["apiary-log-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain":